    {
      "source": "A <a href=\"RevisionMetadata.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.history\"><code>RevisionMetadata</code></a> implementation that inspects the given object for fields with the configured annotations\nand returns the field's values on calls to <a href=\"#getRevisionInstant()\"><code>getRevisionInstant()</code></a>, <a href=\"#getRevisionInstant()\"><code>getRevisionInstant()</code></a> and\n<a href=\"#getRevisionNumber()\"><code>getRevisionNumber()</code></a>.",
      "translation": "一个实现了<a href=\"RevisionMetadata.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.history\"><code>RevisionMetadata</code></a>接口的类，该实现会检查给定对象中带有配置注解的字段，并在调用<a href=\"#getRevisionInstant()\"><code>getRevisionInstant()</code></a>、<a href=\"#getRevisionInstant()\"><code>getRevisionInstant()</code></a>和<a href=\"#getRevisionNumber()\"><code>getRevisionNumber()</code></a>时返回这些字段的值。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the <a href=\"RevisionMetadata.RevisionType.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.data.history\"><code>RevisionMetadata.RevisionType</code></a> of this change. If the <a href=\"RevisionMetadata.RevisionType.html\" title=\"enum class in org.springframework.data.history\"><code>RevisionMetadata.RevisionType</code></a> cannot be determined, this method\nreturns <a href=\"RevisionMetadata.RevisionType.html#UNKNOWN\"><code>RevisionMetadata.RevisionType.UNKNOWN</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回此变更的<a href=\"RevisionMetadata.RevisionType.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.history 中的枚举类\"><code>RevisionMetadata.RevisionType</code></a>。如果无法确定<a href=\"RevisionMetadata.RevisionType.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.history 中的枚举类\"><code>RevisionMetadata.RevisionType</code></a>，则此方法返回<a href=\"RevisionMetadata.RevisionType.html#UNKNOWN\"><code>RevisionMetadata.RevisionType.UNKNOWN</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
