      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"AnnotationRevisionMetadata.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.history\"><code>AnnotationRevisionMetadata</code></a> inspecting the given entity for the given annotations. If no\nannotations will be provided these values will not be looked up from the entity and return null. The\nrevisionType will be set to unknown",
      "translation": "创建一个用于检查给定实体中指定注解的新的 <a href=\"AnnotationRevisionMetadata.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.history\"><code>AnnotationRevisionMetadata</code></a>。如果未提供任何注解，则不会从实体中查找这些值并返回 null。revisionType 将被设置为 unknown。",
      "count": 1
    },
